<main class="wrap" id="main">
<section class="hero">
<p class="eyebrow">Travel &amp; Tourism Operations</p>
<h1>Watch. Understand. Put it into practice.</h1>
<p class="intro">Practical video lessons on tourism operations, service quality and improvement. Open an article to watch in context, or explore a companion lesson below.</p>
